				;--- INT 12 H ---------------------------------
				--------------------------------
				; MEMORY_SIZE_DETERMINE			
								: 
				;	THIS ROUTINE RETURNS THE AMOUNT OF MEMO
				RY IN THE SYSTEM AS		:
				;	DETERMINED BY THE POST ROUTINES. (UP TO
				 640K) 				:
				;	NOTE THAT THE SYSTEM MAY NOT BE ABLE TO
				 USE I/O MEMORY UNLESS		:
				;	THERE IS A FULL COMPLEMENT OF 512K BYTE
				S ON THE PLANAR.			:
