								:
				;	NO REGISTERS			
								:
				;	THE @MEMORY_SIZE VARIABLE IS SET DURING
				 POWER ON DIAGNOSTICS		:
				;	ACCORDING TO THE FOLLOWING ASSUMPTIONS:
									
					:
				;					
								:
				;       1. CONFIGURATION RECORD IN NON-VOLATILE
