				IF THE MEMORY TEST DURING	:
				;          POST INDICATES LESS, THEN THIS VALUE
				 BECOMES THE DEFAULT.		:
				;          IF NON-VOLATILE MEMORY IS NOT VALID 
				(NOT INITIALIZED OR BATTERY	:
